		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Hummock of mossy pulp and ooze with a single ruby-red eye and six tentacles.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 109, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 tentacle (near) +10 (3d10) or acid beam, <strong>MV</strong> far (climb, swim), <strong>S</strong> +7, <strong>D</strong> +5, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +5, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 23</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Acid Beam</strong>. Straight lines (5' wide) extending far from Vorgozen. DEX 15+ or 4d10 damage and pushed back 1d100 feet.</p><p></p><p><strong>Immortal</strong>. Only damaged by magic sources. Immune to acid. If slain, resurrects in 1d10 days and flees.</p><p></p><p><strong>Polluted Magic</strong>. Magic targeting Vorgozen is DC 18. Magic mishaps within far of kaiju are rolled with DISADV.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
